{"slug": "C_S02E17", "video_name": "Community - S02E17 - Intro to Political Science Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E17 - Intro to Political Science Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1242.955, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 547, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.7383783783783784, "text": "Sorry, I go into the bathroom with Tom"}, {"start": 3.7383783783783784, "end": 7.28, "text": "and we both, you know, take him out."}, {"start": 7.28, "end": 11.76, "text": "And I say size more, try size less."}, {"start": 11.76, "end": 16.92, "text": "I want to go to rehab and compare penises with famous people."}, {"start": 16.92, "end": 18.24, "text": "All I could done, kiddo."}, {"start": 18.24, "end": 21.94, "text": "Well, my peers, we're very glad to have you back."}, {"start": 21.94, "end": 22.94, "text": "I'm assuming."}, {"start": 22.94, "end": 23.94, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 23.94, "end": 24.94, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 24.94, "end": 26.44, "text": "So, what should we do now?"}, {"start": 26.44, "end": 28.14, "text": "Well, I don't want to be that guy,"}, {"start": 28.14, "end": 30.64, "text": "but I guess we should start studying anthropology."}, {"start": 33.3958, "end": 34.3958, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 34.3958, "end": 35.3958, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 35.3958, "end": 36.3958, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 36.3958, "end": 37.3958, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 37.3958, "end": 38.3958, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 38.3958, "end": 39.3958, "text": "Um."}, {"start": 39.3958, "end": 40.3958, "text": "Chapter four."}, {"start": 40.3958, "end": 41.3958, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 41.3958, "end": 42.3958, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 42.3958, "end": 43.3958, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 43.3958, "end": 45.3958, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 45.3958, "end": 49.9558, "text": "What is it, Dean?"}, {"start": 49.9558, "end": 52.6358, "text": "Oh, I have exciting news."}, {"start": 52.6358, "end": 54.798558620689654, "text": "Vice President Joe Biden has been visiting"}, {"start": 54.798558620689654, "end": 57.1158, "text": "community colleges across the country as part"}, {"start": 57.1158, "end": 60.0358, "text": "of his Biden time talking about teaching tour."}, {"start": 60.0358, "end": 61.0358, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 61.0358, "end": 62.0358, "text": "Folksy yet progressive."}, {"start": 62.0358, "end": 63.8358, "text": "He does walk that line."}, {"start": 63.8358, "end": 67.30113333333333, "text": "Anyway, his tour is taking him in the neck of the woods and at 5 p.m."}, {"start": 67.30113333333333, "end": 68.35579999999999, "text": "today, he is stopping"}, {"start": 68.35579999999999, "end": 69.35579999999999, "text": "by Greendale."}, {"start": 69.35579999999999, "end": 74.0358, "text": "Eat that city college and wash it down with a nice tall glass, oh, suck it."}, {"start": 74.0358, "end": 76.13579999999999, "text": "The Vice President is coming."}, {"start": 76.13579999999999, "end": 79.1558, "text": "That explains the people I've noticed covertly surveilling the campus this week."}, {"start": 79.1558, "end": 80.1558, "text": "Must be Secret Service."}, {"start": 80.1558, "end": 81.1558, "text": "Oh, Ovid."}, {"start": 81.1558, "end": 83.91579999999999, "text": "Will your reality ever come out on Blue Race a week and enjoy it?"}, {"start": 83.91579999999999, "end": 85.2158, "text": "We've been met."}, {"start": 85.2158, "end": 86.2158, "text": "Only problem."}, {"start": 86.2158, "end": 86.37855862068966, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 86.37855862068966, "end": 88.5486735632184, "text": "Biden is supposed to be meeting with the"}, {"start": 88.5486735632184, "end": 90.9358, "text": "Dean and the head of our student government,"}, {"start": 90.9358, "end": 93.5958, "text": "which in its current form doesn't exist."}, {"start": 93.5958, "end": 97.1558, "text": "So we have seven hours to elect a student president."}, {"start": 97.1558, "end": 99.23580000000001, "text": "Ah, what am I going to wear?"}, {"start": 99.23580000000001, "end": 103.2758, "text": "I mean, I could borrow my sister's Uncle Sam outfit."}, {"start": 103.2758, "end": 106.7158, "text": "It's tailored for ladies, but what else can I do on such short notice?"}, {"start": 106.7158, "end": 111.5958, "text": "Well, you could not dress up like Uncle Sam or admit you don't have a sister."}, {"start": 111.5958, "end": 113.63579999999999, "text": "We're electing a student president."}, {"start": 113.63579999999999, "end": 114.63579999999999, "text": "I want to run."}, {"start": 114.63579999999999, "end": 116.8358, "text": "There's so many ideas for improving the school."}, {"start": 116.8358, "end": 118.8758, "text": "Improving Greendale takes more than ideas, Annie."}, {"start": 118.8758, "end": 119.8758, "text": "It takes time."}, {"start": 119.8758, "end": 120.8758, "text": "Gasoline."}, {"start": 120.8758, "end": 121.8758, "text": "Matches."}, {"start": 121.8758, "end": 122.8758, "text": "Nice."}, {"start": 122.8758, "end": 125.18141797752808, "text": "Well, news flash, Jeff, some of us care about"}, {"start": 125.18141797752808, "end": 127.4358, "text": "more than just fixing our hair and sculpting"}, {"start": 127.4358, "end": 128.4358, "text": "our abs."}, {"start": 128.4358, "end": 129.4358, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 129.4358, "end": 130.4358, "text": "You got me pegged."}, {"start": 130.4358, "end": 131.4358, "text": "Democracy."}, {"start": 131.4358, "end": 132.4358, "text": "What a bruise."}, {"start": 132.4358, "end": 135.8558, "text": "There's no such thing as a system in which the masses hold any attention."}, {"start": 135.8558, "end": 137.01579999999998, "text": "Everyone wants you to shut up."}, {"start": 137.01579999999998, "end": 138.3558, "text": "And yet I won't."}, {"start": 138.3558, "end": 139.3558, "text": "Case in point."}, {"start": 139.3558, "end": 140.3558, "text": "No."}, {"start": 140.3558, "end": 169.7558, "text": "We"}, {"start": 169.7558, "end": 173.1558, "text": "tend to take democracy for granted in America."}, {"start": 173.1558, "end": 176.8818, "text": "But the fact is, men have fought and"}, {"start": 176.8818, "end": 181.4358, "text": "died for the sacred right we exercise today."}, {"start": 181.4358, "end": 187.0958, "text": "So anyone who wants to be president, line up by the ice cream machine."}, {"start": 187.0958, "end": 190.3558, "text": "Your applause will determine who gets into the primaries."}, {"start": 190.3558, "end": 193.6358, "text": "And yes, this is a lady's Uncle Sam outfit."}, {"start": 193.6358, "end": 194.95579999999998, "text": "It's my sister's."}, {"start": 194.95579999999998, "end": 195.95579999999998, "text": "It was last minute."}, {"start": 195.95579999999998, "end": 196.95579999999998, "text": "I had no choice."}, {"start": 196.95579999999998, "end": 199.5916620689655, "text": "I wonder if that's the same sister that tweets me"}, {"start": 199.5916620689655, "end": 201.6358, "text": "to ask if I think her brother is cute."}, {"start": 201.6358, "end": 204.6358, "text": "Jeff, what happened to that pile of campaign flyers I gave you?"}, {"start": 204.6358, "end": 208.67579999999998, "text": "I hung them all up."}, {"start": 208.67579999999998, "end": 209.67579999999998, "text": "Real nice."}, {"start": 209.67579999999998, "end": 211.39579999999998, "text": "Is it too much to ask you to pitch in?"}, {"start": 211.39579999999998, "end": 212.39579999999998, "text": "I'm sorry, Annie."}, {"start": 212.39579999999998, "end": 214.1158, "text": "I'm not the worker bee type."}, {"start": 214.1158, "end": 217.79579999999999, "text": "I'm more of a silverback gorilla with the claws of a lion, the teeth of a shark, and"}, {"start": 217.79579999999999, "end": 219.5958, "text": "the quiet dignity of a tortoise."}, {"start": 219.5958, "end": 220.5958, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 220.5958, "end": 221.5958, "text": "First up is this fella."}, {"start": 221.5958, "end": 222.5958, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 222.5958, "end": 223.5958, "text": "Tell everybody her name."}, {"start": 223.5958, "end": 224.5958, "text": "Garrett?"}, {"start": 224.5958, "end": 225.5958, "text": "Okay, Garrett."}, {"start": 225.5958, "end": 226.5958, "text": "And why?"}, {"start": 226.5958, "end": 228.4758, "text": "Why do you want to be president?"}, {"start": 228.4758, "end": 231.8758, "text": "I wanted ice cream, so I got in line."}, {"start": 231.8758, "end": 232.8758, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 232.8758, "end": 233.8758, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 233.8758, "end": 234.8758, "text": "He wanted ice cream."}, {"start": 234.8758, "end": 235.8758, "text": "So what do we say, gang?"}, {"start": 235.8758, "end": 237.1558, "text": "Does he make it to the next round?"}, {"start": 237.1558, "end": 238.1558, "text": "Buy applause?"}, {"start": 238.1558, "end": 239.1558, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 239.1558, "end": 240.1558, "text": "We've got our first nominee."}, {"start": 240.1558, "end": 241.1558, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 241.1558, "end": 242.1558, "text": "The bar has been set."}, {"start": 242.1558, "end": 243.1558, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 243.1558, "end": 244.1558, "text": "Stay to the side."}, {"start": 244.1558, "end": 245.1558, "text": "Stay to the side."}, {"start": 245.1558, "end": 247.4358, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 247.4358, "end": 250.9158, "text": "At least worker bees can set aside their egos and join together to support a larger"}, {"start": 250.9158, "end": 251.9158, "text": "cause."}, {"start": 251.9158, "end": 252.9158, "text": "Oh, right."}, {"start": 252.9158, "end": 256.11580000000004, "text": "Because politics are all about larger causes."}, {"start": 256.11580000000004, "end": 261.99580000000003, "text": "Based on any, politics are all about ego, popularity, and parlor tricks."}, {"start": 261.99580000000003, "end": 262.99580000000003, "text": "Don't kid a lawyer."}, {"start": 262.99580000000003, "end": 265.0758, "text": "Well, if I see one, I won't."}, {"start": 265.0758, "end": 266.0758, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 266.0758, "end": 267.0758, "text": "It's a girl."}, {"start": 267.0758, "end": 268.0758, "text": "Look at this."}, {"start": 268.0758, "end": 269.0758, "text": "She's got a yellow shirt and a hat."}, {"start": 269.0758, "end": 270.0758, "text": "Who are you, sweetie?"}, {"start": 270.0758, "end": 271.0758, "text": "Uh, Vicki?"}, {"start": 271.0758, "end": 272.0758, "text": "Who's up for some Vicki, huh?"}, {"start": 272.0758, "end": 273.0758, "text": "I'm Edna Deere."}, {"start": 273.0758, "end": 277.5758, "text": "I'm Special Agent Robin Bowlers, Special Agent"}, {"start": 277.5758, "end": 282.0758, "text": "Keeneland of the United States Secret Service."}, {"start": 282.0758, "end": 285.0758, "text": "Will you submit to a search of your person and belongings?"}, {"start": 285.0758, "end": 286.0758, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 286.0758, "end": 290.8758, "text": "If I may ask, how did you notice the campus was being observed?"}, {"start": 290.8758, "end": 293.67580000000004, "text": "I guess I noticed because I'm used to being the only observer."}, {"start": 293.67580000000004, "end": 297.0358, "text": "Well, we're not used to being noticed."}, {"start": 297.0358, "end": 300.67580000000004, "text": "That sounds a little sad."}, {"start": 300.67580000000004, "end": 303.35580000000004, "text": "He's clean."}, {"start": 303.35580000000004, "end": 306.8358, "text": "Although I could issue a warning for this bootleg of the last airbender."}, {"start": 306.8358, "end": 308.99580000000003, "text": "Where were you a week ago?"}, {"start": 308.99580000000003, "end": 311.3958, "text": "We'll keep it."}, {"start": 311.3958, "end": 318.2758, "text": "Well, another one makes the cut, congratulations, Leonard."}, {"start": 318.2758, "end": 320.3958, "text": "Yes, wonderful."}, {"start": 320.3958, "end": 325.1958, "text": "Next up, Annie Edison."}, {"start": 325.1958, "end": 330.91580000000005, "text": "My name is Annie Edison, and if elected, I promise to make Greendale the signature"}, {"start": 330.91580000000005, "end": 335.3958, "text": "community college of the entire western three quarters of the Greendale area."}, {"start": 335.3958, "end": 341.1958, "text": "Oh, looks like you're in the running, Annie."}, {"start": 341.1958, "end": 343.85580000000004, "text": "Looks like it is hard not to be."}, {"start": 343.85580000000004, "end": 344.85580000000004, "text": "Next up."}, {"start": 344.85580000000004, "end": 347.35580000000004, "text": "I'm sorry, I got to eat, I got to go."}, {"start": 347.35580000000004, "end": 350.23580000000004, "text": "I believe that humankind need not be governed."}, {"start": 354.90700000000004, "end": 356.827, "text": "I don't care."}, {"start": 356.827, "end": 362.107, "text": "Well, it's good to know there's a floor on this thing, so thank you, Miss Perry."}, {"start": 362.107, "end": 363.107, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 363.107, "end": 366.107, "text": "Oh, Annie, I'm so proud of you."}, {"start": 366.107, "end": 367.107, "text": "I love you."}, {"start": 367.107, "end": 369.3018235294118, "text": "I believe this campus is a good place filled"}, {"start": 369.3018235294118, "end": 371.34700000000004, "text": "with good people who just need someone to"}, {"start": 371.34700000000004, "end": 376.747, "text": "protect their interests."}, {"start": 376.747, "end": 381.507, "text": "My name is Jeff, I'm no politician, I'm just a fella."}, {"start": 381.507, "end": 385.58700000000005, "text": "I think that beer should be cold and boots should be dusty."}, {"start": 385.58700000000005, "end": 392.067, "text": "I think 9/11 was bad, and freedom, well, I think that's just a little bit better."}, {"start": 392.067, "end": 410.78700000000003, "text": "The"}, {"start": 410.78700000000003, "end": 412.52765934065934, "text": "countdown has begun, and at five tonight, one"}, {"start": 412.52765934065934, "end": 414.307, "text": "student will be president, while the rest will"}, {"start": 414.307, "end": 415.307, "text": "simply be."}, {"start": 415.307, "end": 418.627, "text": "For Greendale Campus TV, I'm Abed Nadir, and I'm Troy \"Buttsuit\" Barnes."}, {"start": 418.627, "end": 419.627, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 419.627, "end": 420.627, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 420.627, "end": 421.627, "text": "That's my name."}, {"start": 421.627, "end": 422.627, "text": "That's none of the debates."}, {"start": 422.627, "end": 424.34700000000004, "text": "There are eight candidates in the league."}, {"start": 424.34700000000004, "end": 425.34700000000004, "text": "Annie Edison."}, {"start": 425.34700000000004, "end": 426.34700000000004, "text": "Smart."}, {"start": 426.34700000000004, "end": 427.34700000000004, "text": "Attractive, but easily vexed."}, {"start": 427.34700000000004, "end": 428.34700000000004, "text": "Leonard Rodriguez."}, {"start": 428.34700000000004, "end": 429.34700000000004, "text": "Did he change his last name?"}, {"start": 429.34700000000004, "end": 430.34700000000004, "text": "Yeah, he's trying to court the Hispanic vote."}, {"start": 430.34700000000004, "end": 431.34700000000004, "text": "Alex Starburns Osborne."}, {"start": 431.34700000000004, "end": 432.34700000000004, "text": "Creepy."}, {"start": 432.34700000000004, "end": 433.34700000000004, "text": "Seems Greek."}, {"start": 433.34700000000004, "end": 434.34700000000004, "text": "Possible drug dealer."}, {"start": 434.34700000000004, "end": 435.34700000000004, "text": "Jeff Winger."}, {"start": 435.34700000000004, "end": 436.34700000000004, "text": "Crowd favorite."}, {"start": 436.34700000000004, "end": 437.34700000000004, "text": "They call him Hot Wings."}, {"start": 437.34700000000004, "end": 438.34700000000004, "text": "Magitude."}, {"start": 438.34700000000004, "end": 439.34700000000004, "text": "Short for magnetic attitude, he's a one-man party."}, {"start": 439.34700000000004, "end": 440.34700000000004, "text": "Pierce Hawthorne."}, {"start": 440.34700000000004, "end": 441.34700000000004, "text": "The Wizard of Wet Wipes."}, {"start": 441.34700000000004, "end": 442.34700000000004, "text": "I live with that dude."}, {"start": 442.34700000000004, "end": 443.827, "text": "He's got night terrors and a rotary phone."}, {"start": 443.827, "end": 444.827, "text": "Garrett."}, {"start": 444.827, "end": 445.827, "text": "That guy's just a mess."}, {"start": 445.827, "end": 447.22700000000003, "text": "It's like God spilled a person."}, {"start": 447.22700000000003, "end": 448.22700000000003, "text": "And Vicki."}, {"start": 448.22700000000003, "end": 449.22700000000003, "text": "Yellow shirt."}, {"start": 449.22700000000003, "end": 450.22700000000003, "text": "Hat."}, {"start": 450.22700000000003, "end": 455.46700000000004, "text": "You know, you gotta ask yourself right now, Abed, what's up with politics?"}, {"start": 455.46700000000004, "end": 456.46700000000004, "text": "Yeah, yeah."}, {"start": 456.46700000000004, "end": 457.46700000000004, "text": "You're precisely right, Troy."}, {"start": 457.46700000000004, "end": 459.34700000000004, "text": "You know, I hear they're getting ready to start, so we'll turn her over to coverage"}, {"start": 459.34700000000004, "end": 460.34700000000004, "text": "on the debates."}, {"start": 460.34700000000004, "end": 466.627, "text": "Who's there?"}, {"start": 466.627, "end": 469.107, "text": "Special Agent Voler's United States Secret Service."}, {"start": 469.107, "end": 472.34700000000004, "text": "Do you just constantly have your own little side adventures?"}, {"start": 472.34700000000004, "end": 473.34700000000004, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 473.34700000000004, "end": 474.34700000000004, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 474.34700000000004, "end": 478.9181111111111, "text": "Jeff, knock"}, {"start": 478.9181111111111, "end": 481.827, "text": "it off."}, {"start": 481.827, "end": 482.827, "text": "You're not running sincerely."}, {"start": 482.827, "end": 484.66700000000003, "text": "You're not even interested in student government."}, {"start": 484.66700000000003, "end": 486.867, "text": "I know, and yet the people love me."}, {"start": 486.867, "end": 489.507, "text": "It's almost as if politics were a huge joke."}, {"start": 489.507, "end": 491.96700000000004, "text": "Okay, look, I'm sorry I asked you to hang"}, {"start": 491.96700000000004, "end": 494.547, "text": "my fliers, but I suggest you drop out right"}, {"start": 494.547, "end": 497.867, "text": "now, because if not only will I beat you, I will make you cry."}, {"start": 497.867, "end": 501.627, "text": "Oh, I feel a slight ego blowing in from the east."}, {"start": 501.627, "end": 503.827, "text": "You're gonna feel my foot blowing in from the south."}, {"start": 503.827, "end": 504.867, "text": "Bring it on, Ponce de Leon."}, {"start": 504.867, "end": 505.867, "text": "I'm gonna, Greg Molduna."}, {"start": 505.867, "end": 506.867, "text": "It's a real guy."}, {"start": 506.867, "end": 507.867, "text": "He owns a mattress store downtown."}, {"start": 507.867, "end": 508.84700000000004, "text": "You can look it up."}, {"start": 508.84700000000004, "end": 509.84700000000004, "text": "Hey, Vicki."}, {"start": 509.84700000000004, "end": 510.84700000000004, "text": "Psst."}, {"start": 510.84700000000004, "end": 511.84700000000004, "text": "Vicki, look at me."}, {"start": 511.84700000000004, "end": 512.847, "text": "Psst."}, {"start": 512.847, "end": 513.847, "text": "I'm going to crush you."}, {"start": 513.847, "end": 514.847, "text": "Pierce, stop that."}, {"start": 514.847, "end": 515.847, "text": "I'm gonna eat your brains, Vicki."}, {"start": 515.847, "end": 521.369033898305, "text": "I'm gonna slurp them right out"}, {"start": 521.369033898305, "end": 526.707, "text": "of that melon you call ahead."}, {"start": 526.707, "end": 530.5070000000001, "text": "A reminder to all candidates, your microphones are currently on."}, {"start": 530.5070000000001, "end": 534.067, "text": "Well, they better be, because I'm on fire up here."}, {"start": 534.067, "end": 536.067, "text": "You freak people out, you know that?"}, {"start": 536.067, "end": 538.587, "text": "You look weird."}, {"start": 538.587, "end": 539.587, "text": "Because of your overbite."}, {"start": 539.587, "end": 542.107, "text": "Okay, let's just get started."}, {"start": 542.107, "end": 545.8670000000001, "text": "Welcome to the Greendale Community College presidential debate."}, {"start": 545.8670000000001, "end": 550.067, "text": "Candidates, if elected, what will you do?"}, {"start": 550.067, "end": 551.447, "text": "Oh, Annie."}, {"start": 551.447, "end": 554.307, "text": "I'm running on a platform of school improvement."}, {"start": 554.307, "end": 558.827, "text": "If I'm elected, the black mold will be removed from the east stairwell."}, {"start": 558.827, "end": 563.467, "text": "The assailant, known only as the ass-crack bandit, will be brought to justice."}, {"start": 563.467, "end": 568.347, "text": "And I will balance the school's budget by eliminating administrative redundancy."}, {"start": 568.347, "end": 571.707, "text": "Okay, I'm in the room."}, {"start": 571.707, "end": 573.5070000000001, "text": "Thank you, Miss Edison."}, {"start": 573.5070000000001, "end": 573.807, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 573.807, "end": 574.5070000000001, "text": "Winger."}, {"start": 574.5070000000001, "end": 575.5070000000001, "text": "Well, that's an important question."}, {"start": 575.5070000000001, "end": 581.147, "text": "And it's important to students like Jeremy, who told me today that he is majoring in"}, {"start": 581.147, "end": 584.3870000000001, "text": "astronomy and is supporting two children."}, {"start": 584.3870000000001, "end": 587.1218837209302, "text": "It's an important question to Maria, who's"}, {"start": 587.1218837209302, "end": 589.987, "text": "a beautiful Latina, Bonin Nicaragua, working"}, {"start": 589.987, "end": 590.987, "text": "in the cafeteria."}, {"start": 590.987, "end": 592.947, "text": "What will I do, Dean?"}, {"start": 592.947, "end": 596.767, "text": "Well, these people don't want me to say what I'll do."}, {"start": 596.767, "end": 599.587, "text": "They want me to do what I'll say."}, {"start": 599.587, "end": 606.027, "text": "They level the shuffle of words around."}, {"start": 606.027, "end": 607.027, "text": "Magnitude?"}, {"start": 607.027, "end": 608.027, "text": "Same question."}, {"start": 608.027, "end": 609.027, "text": "Same answer."}, {"start": 609.027, "end": 613.419024024024, "text": "Mind if I ask you"}, {"start": 613.419024024024, "end": 618.5861111111111, "text": "a few questions, Mr."}, {"start": 618.5861111111111, "end": 620.347, "text": "Nadeer?"}, {"start": 620.347, "end": 620.687, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 621.504, "end": 623.044, "text": "- Is there a specific reason you had to repeat"}, {"start": 623.044, "end": 624.124, "text": "the first grade?"}, {"start": 624.124, "end": 626.644, "text": "- Well, from what I'm told, I didn't know how to use scissors."}, {"start": 626.644, "end": 627.764, "text": "I sat in the middle of the seesaw."}, {"start": 627.764, "end": 628.604, "text": "And I always found the distinction"}, {"start": 628.604, "end": 630.3240000000001, "text": "between duck and goose to be very arbitrary."}, {"start": 630.3240000000001, "end": 631.924, "text": "- Couldn't you just pick the sixth kid every time?"}, {"start": 631.924, "end": 635.604, "text": "That's what I would've done."}, {"start": 635.604, "end": 636.604, "text": "- I went with four."}, {"start": 639.224, "end": 641.024, "text": "- Geez, get a room, you two."}, {"start": 642.2040000000001, "end": 644.2040000000001, "text": "- Pierce Hawthorne, your platform?"}, {"start": 644.2040000000001, "end": 646.0840000000001, "text": "- My platform will be one high enough"}, {"start": 646.0840000000001, "end": 647.984, "text": "to push Vicky off to her death."}, {"start": 649.564, "end": 650.804, "text": "- Vicky?"}, {"start": 650.804, "end": 652.2040000000001, "text": "It looks like Vicky's out of the race."}, {"start": 652.2040000000001, "end": 653.924, "text": "- Oh, well then I am too."}, {"start": 653.924, "end": 655.2040000000001, "text": "I was only here to get back at her"}, {"start": 655.2040000000001, "end": 656.684, "text": "for not lending me a pencil."}, {"start": 656.684, "end": 657.604, "text": "- Oh, okay."}, {"start": 657.604, "end": 658.964, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 658.964, "end": 659.804, "text": "- Well?"}, {"start": 659.804, "end": 661.364, "text": "- Can we get back on track here?"}, {"start": 661.364, "end": 665.2040000000001, "text": "I just want to get the black mold out of the east stairwell."}, {"start": 665.2040000000001, "end": 669.2040000000001, "text": "I just want to clean up Greendale."}, {"start": 669.2040000000001, "end": 670.804, "text": "- Are you saying Greendale is dirty?"}, {"start": 670.804, "end": 671.644, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 671.644, "end": 673.284, "text": "- Boo."}, {"start": 673.284, "end": 674.124, "text": "Boo."}, {"start": 675.5640000000001, "end": 676.724, "text": "- Of course it's dirty."}, {"start": 676.724, "end": 677.884, "text": "Everyone knows that."}, {"start": 677.884, "end": 678.804, "text": "- I don't, Annie."}, {"start": 679.764, "end": 681.284, "text": "I think it's clean."}, {"start": 681.284, "end": 684.484, "text": "I think it's the cleanest school in the entire country."}, {"start": 684.484, "end": 685.804, "text": "(audience cheering)"}, {"start": 685.804, "end": 687.5640000000001, "text": "- Looks like Jeff Williams really got this thing in the bag."}, {"start": 687.5640000000001, "end": 688.524, "text": "- Sure does, Troy."}, {"start": 688.524, "end": 689.5640000000001, "text": "Say what you will about this or that,"}, {"start": 689.5640000000001, "end": 691.764, "text": "but people just like the guy."}, {"start": 691.764, "end": 695.404, "text": "- Read my lips."}, {"start": 695.404, "end": 698.284, "text": "No matter what you're told,"}, {"start": 698.284, "end": 701.604, "text": "we have to clean the mold."}, {"start": 701.604, "end": 704.244, "text": "No matter what you're told,"}, {"start": 704.244, "end": 706.484, "text": "we have to clean the mold."}, {"start": 706.484, "end": 707.5640000000001, "text": "That's right, people."}, {"start": 707.5640000000001, "end": 709.884, "text": "No matter what you're told,"}, {"start": 709.884, "end": 712.164, "text": "we have to clean the mold."}, {"start": 712.164, "end": 713.004, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 713.004, "end": 713.844, "text": "No matter what you're told."}, {"start": 713.844, "end": 714.684, "text": "- This is interesting."}, {"start": 714.684, "end": 716.964, "text": "Annie Edison has reduced her platform to one issue"}, {"start": 716.964, "end": 718.524, "text": "and turned that issue into a sound bite."}, {"start": 718.524, "end": 719.644, "text": "- And it rhymes."}, {"start": 719.644, "end": 721.684, "text": "People love it."}, {"start": 721.684, "end": 723.364, "text": "This election's become a real horse race."}, {"start": 723.364, "end": 724.724, "text": "According to our polls,"}, {"start": 724.724, "end": 726.484, "text": "the campus is almost evenly divided."}, {"start": 726.484, "end": 727.3240000000001, "text": "Now keep in mind,"}, {"start": 727.3240000000001, "end": 729.164, "text": "the margin of error on this thing is about 98%."}, {"start": 729.164, "end": 730.004, "text": "- Could be higher."}, {"start": 730.004, "end": 731.044, "text": "We don't even know how to do margins of error."}, {"start": 731.044, "end": 732.284, "text": "We talked to two people out of vending machine."}, {"start": 732.284, "end": 733.924, "text": "- Well, I'm being told we're taking a quick break,"}, {"start": 733.924, "end": 734.764, "text": "but stay tuned."}, {"start": 734.764, "end": 735.604, "text": "- They have to stay tuned."}, {"start": 735.604, "end": 736.444, "text": "It's closed circuit television."}, {"start": 736.444, "end": 737.284, "text": "- Don't know what that means."}, {"start": 737.284, "end": 738.124, "text": "- And we're out."}, {"start": 740.444, "end": 741.684, "text": "Can I get an apple juice, please?"}, {"start": 741.684, "end": 743.004, "text": "Freshly squeezed this time or so."}, {"start": 743.004, "end": 744.764, "text": "Help me God, Maurice."}, {"start": 744.764, "end": 745.604, "text": "- I'll bet."}, {"start": 745.604, "end": 748.2040000000001, "text": "Those guys in the suits are flashing you down real bad,"}, {"start": 748.2040000000001, "end": 749.044, "text": "though."}, {"start": 757.284, "end": 758.124, "text": "- What are you doing?"}, {"start": 758.124, "end": 758.964, "text": "- Random spot check."}, {"start": 758.964, "end": 759.1381935483871, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 759.1381935483871, "end": 760.764, "text": "Nadeer, stay out of our way."}, {"start": 760.764, "end": 761.764, "text": "- Nothing suspicious."}, {"start": 761.764, "end": 763.364, "text": "- Glenn, bring the car around."}, {"start": 768.004, "end": 768.884, "text": "- What are you looking for, Robin?"}, {"start": 768.884, "end": 771.284, "text": "- Fertilizer, car battery, PVC piping."}, {"start": 771.284, "end": 772.244, "text": "Anything suspicious."}, {"start": 772.244, "end": 773.884, "text": "- Because you think I'm suspicious?"}, {"start": 775.8040000000001, "end": 778.164, "text": "Or because you wish I was suspicious"}, {"start": 778.164, "end": 779.5640000000001, "text": "so that you'd have an excuse to see more of me."}, {"start": 779.5640000000001, "end": 780.684, "text": "- This was a random spot check."}, {"start": 780.684, "end": 781.524, "text": "- Do you like me?"}, {"start": 781.524, "end": 782.764, "text": "- That's not really relevant."}, {"start": 784.684, "end": 785.684, "text": "That's close enough."}, {"start": 786.684, "end": 787.524, "text": "- Are you sure?"}, {"start": 789.164, "end": 790.524, "text": "- You smell like nice soap."}, {"start": 791.524, "end": 792.364, "text": "I have to go."}, {"start": 795.884, "end": 797.3240000000001, "text": "- I'm sorry you weren't a more obvious"}, {"start": 797.3240000000001, "end": 798.884, "text": "potential threat to the country."}, {"start": 804.524, "end": 807.364, "text": "- People are pretty excited about this black mold issue."}, {"start": 807.364, "end": 808.204, "text": "- We'll see."}, {"start": 808.204, "end": 809.044, "text": "For my closing statement,"}, {"start": 809.044, "end": 811.0840000000001, "text": "I'm thinking about smashing a watermelon with a hammer."}, {"start": 811.0840000000001, "end": 813.444, "text": "- Jeff, if I admit politics are stupid,"}, {"start": 813.444, "end": 814.964, "text": "will you stop making them stupid?"}, {"start": 814.964, "end": 815.8040000000001, "text": "You're gonna split the vote"}, {"start": 815.8040000000001, "end": 817.5640000000001, "text": "and Starburns is gonna end up president."}, {"start": 817.5640000000001, "end": 818.724, "text": "I'm the only one up here"}, {"start": 818.724, "end": 819.924, "text": "who's trying to get something done."}, {"start": 819.924, "end": 822.644, "text": "- And you deserve to be allowed to do it?"}, {"start": 822.644, "end": 825.004, "text": "You're entitled to be president?"}, {"start": 825.004, "end": 826.3240000000001, "text": "The gloves are coming off."}, {"start": 826.3240000000001, "end": 827.604, "text": "You understand me?"}, {"start": 827.604, "end": 829.724, "text": "I have an audio visual presentation."}, {"start": 829.724, "end": 830.844, "text": "- Wow, I'm shaking."}, {"start": 830.844, "end": 831.924, "text": "- You should be."}, {"start": 831.924, "end": 832.764, "text": "You should be."}, {"start": 832.764, "end": 835.8040000000001, "text": "All right, let us resume."}, {"start": 835.8040000000001, "end": 838.164, "text": "Starburns, we haven't heard from you"}, {"start": 838.164, "end": 839.524, "text": "on this black mold issue."}, {"start": 839.524, "end": 842.004, "text": "- Yeah, I actually withdraw my candidacy."}, {"start": 842.004, "end": 844.964, "text": "I fear a political career will shine a negative light"}, {"start": 844.964, "end": 846.284, "text": "on my drug dealing."}, {"start": 846.284, "end": 847.124, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 848.124, "end": 851.164, "text": "- Dean, before this election stops being about the issues,"}, {"start": 851.164, "end": 853.924, "text": "I have a question for my opponents."}, {"start": 853.924, "end": 855.524, "text": "What's your favorite color?"}, {"start": 855.524, "end": 857.444, "text": "Mine's a three-way tie."}, {"start": 857.444, "end": 860.364, "text": "Red, white, and blue."}, {"start": 860.364, "end": 862.164, "text": "(audience applauds)"}, {"start": 862.164, "end": 863.924, "text": "- Magnitude, response?"}, {"start": 863.924, "end": 865.444, "text": "- I think you know, Dean."}, {"start": 866.484, "end": 867.964, "text": "- Papa!"}, {"start": 867.964, "end": 870.8040000000001, "text": "(audience laughs)"}, {"start": 872.444, "end": 873.404, "text": "- I set 'em up."}, {"start": 873.404, "end": 875.884, "text": "- I have an audio visual presentation, Dean."}, {"start": 875.884, "end": 877.444, "text": "- Oh, well, that sounds interesting."}, {"start": 877.444, "end": 878.8040000000001, "text": "What's your presentation, Annie?"}, {"start": 878.8040000000001, "end": 880.244, "text": "- My presentation is a copy"}, {"start": 880.244, "end": 882.844, "text": "of Jeff Winger's 1997 audition tape"}, {"start": 882.844, "end": 884.844, "text": "for MTV's \"The Real World.\""}, {"start": 884.844, "end": 886.5640000000001, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 886.5640000000001, "end": 887.764, "text": "- Let's just roll it."}, {"start": 887.764, "end": 888.604, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 890.284, "end": 891.9639999999999, "text": "- Hey, I'm Jeff Winger,"}, {"start": 891.9639999999999, "end": 895.004, "text": "and I'd love to be on MTV's \"Real World Seattle.\""}, {"start": 895.004, "end": 896.404, "text": "So check this out."}, {"start": 896.404, "end": 898.984, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 900.364, "end": 902.884, "text": "♪ Oh, well, I guess it would be nice ♪"}, {"start": 902.884, "end": 905.3240000000001, "text": "♪ If I could be on MTV ♪"}, {"start": 905.3240000000001, "end": 907.844, "text": "♪ So please, can you take a look at me ♪"}, {"start": 907.844, "end": 909.844, "text": "♪ For the real world ♪"}, {"start": 909.844, "end": 912.8040000000001, "text": "♪ Oh, I'm going likewise ♪"}, {"start": 912.8040000000001, "end": 916.204, "text": "- Folks, who do you want shaking Joe Biden's hand"}, {"start": 916.204, "end": 917.604, "text": "at 5 p.m.?"}, {"start": 917.604, "end": 918.444, "text": "Me or me?"}, {"start": 920.644, "end": 921.484, "text": "- Shut up!"}, {"start": 921.484, "end": 922.884, "text": "It was like 19."}, {"start": 922.884, "end": 924.604, "text": "- We all were meant to be, Jeff."}, {"start": 924.604, "end": 926.244, "text": "And none of us did this."}, {"start": 926.244, "end": 927.0840000000001, "text": "None of us."}, {"start": 929.124, "end": 929.9639999999999, "text": "Pop, pop."}, {"start": 931.284, "end": 932.5640000000001, "text": "- I hate you."}, {"start": 932.5640000000001, "end": 934.684, "text": "I hate this school."}, {"start": 934.684, "end": 937.004, "text": "And I hope you all get black bone poisoning."}, {"start": 937.004, "end": 937.9639999999999, "text": "- Pop, Jeffrey, no!"}, {"start": 937.9639999999999, "end": 939.364, "text": "- I hate you."}, {"start": 939.364, "end": 940.204, "text": "- I hate you."}, {"start": 940.204, "end": 942.364, "text": "- No, Jeffrey, no."}, {"start": 942.364, "end": 946.364, "text": "♪ You and I have a jam, jam, jam ♪"}, {"start": 951.3789999999999, "end": 952.4989999999999, "text": "- Are you in here?"}, {"start": 953.539, "end": 955.4989999999999, "text": "- Yeah, to be alone."}, {"start": 955.4989999999999, "end": 958.3789999999999, "text": "We've already established the men's room doesn't work."}, {"start": 958.3789999999999, "end": 959.6589999999999, "text": "- You have an apartment?"}, {"start": 959.6589999999999, "end": 963.0989999999999, "text": "- There are people in the parking lot singing that song."}, {"start": 963.0989999999999, "end": 965.059, "text": "- I went too far."}, {"start": 965.059, "end": 965.9789999999999, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 965.9789999999999, "end": 968.0989999999999, "text": "I didn't know it would be that bad."}, {"start": 968.0989999999999, "end": 969.2189999999999, "text": "- You knew."}, {"start": 969.2189999999999, "end": 970.8989999999999, "text": "You didn't care."}, {"start": 970.8989999999999, "end": 973.2189999999999, "text": "I don't apologize if I got what I deserved."}, {"start": 974.299, "end": 978.4189999999999, "text": "- I am a gross jaded adult with control issues"}, {"start": 978.4189999999999, "end": 980.299, "text": "that couldn't let a young, bright,"}, {"start": 980.299, "end": 982.539, "text": "idealistic kid run for president."}, {"start": 986.3389999999999, "end": 988.6189999999999, "text": "Wait, isn't there a final round of debates?"}, {"start": 988.6189999999999, "end": 989.459, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 991.3389999999999, "end": 992.819, "text": "- You guys, you're missing it."}, {"start": 992.819, "end": 994.7389999999999, "text": "- Troy, I'm out."}, {"start": 994.7389999999999, "end": 995.579, "text": "- Me too."}, {"start": 995.579, "end": 997.3389999999999, "text": "I withdrew my candidacy."}, {"start": 997.3389999999999, "end": 998.9389999999999, "text": "Nobody that treats a friend the way that I did"}, {"start": 998.9389999999999, "end": 1000.8589999999999, "text": "is fit to represent the student body."}, {"start": 1000.8589999999999, "end": 1002.6189999999999, "text": "- Yeah, I know you're both out."}, {"start": 1002.6189999999999, "end": 1004.059, "text": "I'm saying you're missing it."}, {"start": 1004.059, "end": 1006.299, "text": "It's the political showdown of the century."}, {"start": 1007.459, "end": 1008.299, "text": "- Pa pa."}, {"start": 1009.8589999999999, "end": 1010.6989999999998, "text": "Pa pa."}, {"start": 1012.1789999999999, "end": 1013.019, "text": "Pa pa."}, {"start": 1014.1389999999999, "end": 1015.579, "text": "Pa pa."}, {"start": 1015.579, "end": 1017.1789999999999, "text": "- You should have stayed in the running."}, {"start": 1017.1789999999999, "end": 1018.579, "text": "You're the only real candidate."}, {"start": 1018.579, "end": 1022.0989999999999, "text": "- No, I was just another jerk trying to win a contest."}, {"start": 1022.0989999999999, "end": 1023.3389999999999, "text": "You were right the whole time."}, {"start": 1023.3389999999999, "end": 1024.379, "text": "I just couldn't admit it"}, {"start": 1024.379, "end": 1026.6589999999999, "text": "until I saw you running away crying."}, {"start": 1027.4989999999998, "end": 1028.379, "text": "- Yay."}, {"start": 1028.379, "end": 1031.139, "text": "- I care what you think about me, you know?"}, {"start": 1031.139, "end": 1033.899, "text": "- Yeah, well, I care what you think about me."}, {"start": 1034.779, "end": 1035.899, "text": "That's why this happened."}, {"start": 1035.899, "end": 1036.9389999999999, "text": "- Okay, well,"}, {"start": 1038.779, "end": 1040.219, "text": "resolved then."}, {"start": 1041.4589999999998, "end": 1042.299, "text": "- Resolved."}, {"start": 1045.779, "end": 1048.139, "text": "- When we seek to destroy others,"}, {"start": 1048.139, "end": 1049.619, "text": "we often hurt ourselves"}, {"start": 1051.299, "end": 1054.299, "text": "because it is the self that wants to be destroyed."}, {"start": 1055.1789999999999, "end": 1057.859, "text": "- Pierce, you're not usually so poignant."}, {"start": 1057.859, "end": 1061.6989999999998, "text": "- Well, Vicki finally let me your pencil."}, {"start": 1061.6989999999998, "end": 1065.219, "text": "- Oh my God, Pierce, go to the health center."}, {"start": 1065.219, "end": 1066.059, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1067.299, "end": 1069.539, "text": "- Well, finally reached the end of election road."}, {"start": 1069.539, "end": 1070.619, "text": "Arguments have been made."}, {"start": 1070.619, "end": 1071.6589999999999, "text": "Pops have been popped."}, {"start": 1071.6589999999999, "end": 1074.259, "text": "- Hearts have been stirred, preps broken."}, {"start": 1074.259, "end": 1076.539, "text": "- The only thing that remains is to tally the vote"}, {"start": 1076.539, "end": 1080.4989999999998, "text": "in this matchup between the youthful, charismatic magnitude"}, {"start": 1080.4989999999998, "end": 1082.299, "text": "and Leonard the human raised in Rodriguez."}, {"start": 1082.299, "end": 1084.6989999999998, "text": "- Two men fighting for the same piece of earth."}, {"start": 1084.6989999999998, "end": 1086.6589999999999, "text": "One recently born, one soon to die."}, {"start": 1086.6589999999999, "end": 1089.219, "text": "A competition reflecting the pointlessness of life."}, {"start": 1090.1789999999999, "end": 1092.139, "text": "- Pull up, Abed, you're in a nosedive."}, {"start": 1092.139, "end": 1094.259, "text": "I'm being told now that Dean Pelton is prepared"}, {"start": 1094.259, "end": 1095.099, "text": "to announce a winner."}, {"start": 1095.099, "end": 1097.059, "text": "We take you now live to Across the Room."}, {"start": 1097.059, "end": 1099.4589999999998, "text": "- Okay, here we go."}, {"start": 1099.4589999999998, "end": 1101.299, "text": "Thank you, Sergio."}, {"start": 1101.299, "end": 1105.139, "text": "- With 11 votes cast, 11, come on, people."}, {"start": 1106.6989999999998, "end": 1110.379, "text": "The landslide winner of the student election"}, {"start": 1110.379, "end": 1112.779, "text": "with seven votes is"}, {"start": 1114.6989999999998, "end": 1115.6989999999998, "text": "South Park."}, {"start": 1117.019, "end": 1118.819, "text": "Okay, you know what?"}, {"start": 1118.819, "end": 1121.4589999999998, "text": "I seem to recall this is why we abolished student government"}, {"start": 1121.4589999999998, "end": 1122.739, "text": "in the first place."}, {"start": 1122.739, "end": 1125.259, "text": "This is exactly what happened 10 years ago."}, {"start": 1126.259, "end": 1129.259, "text": "- Hey, how hard is it to get rid of black mold?"}, {"start": 1129.259, "end": 1131.1789999999999, "text": "What do we need, buckets and sponges?"}, {"start": 1132.059, "end": 1133.6989999999998, "text": "- I don't actually know."}, {"start": 1134.9389999999999, "end": 1135.779, "text": "I'll look it up."}, {"start": 1137.4589999999998, "end": 1138.9389999999999, "text": "- I'm a lady."}, {"start": 1138.9389999999999, "end": 1140.139, "text": "- Well, there you have it."}, {"start": 1140.139, "end": 1141.5389999999998, "text": "In a shocking right and upset,"}, {"start": 1141.5389999999998, "end": 1143.9389999999999, "text": "the Comedy Central cartoon series South Park"}, {"start": 1143.9389999999999, "end": 1146.4989999999998, "text": "has been elected president of the Greendale student body."}, {"start": 1146.4989999999998, "end": 1148.579, "text": "- Not that jacking to me, I voted for it."}, {"start": 1148.579, "end": 1149.4189999999999, "text": "- For real?"}, {"start": 1149.4189999999999, "end": 1150.259, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 1150.259, "end": 1153.139, "text": "Oh, we can never stop being friends."}, {"start": 1153.139, "end": 1154.379, "text": "- As the confetti gets swept away"}, {"start": 1154.379, "end": 1156.059, "text": "and we begin gearing up for next year's election,"}, {"start": 1156.059, "end": 1158.179, "text": "for GCTV, I'm Abed Nadir saying,"}, {"start": 1158.179, "end": 1159.139, "text": "did you know you can make napalm"}, {"start": 1159.139, "end": 1161.4589999999998, "text": "on a common dish soap and cat food?"}, {"start": 1161.4589999999998, "end": 1162.779, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1162.779, "end": 1164.5389999999998, "text": "Why would you say that, hmm?"}, {"start": 1164.5389999999998, "end": 1167.139, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 1171.4589999999998, "end": 1172.899, "text": "- The ballers."}, {"start": 1172.899, "end": 1173.739, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1176.0189999999998, "end": 1176.859, "text": "I'm sorry, sir, we're gonna have"}, {"start": 1176.859, "end": 1178.179, "text": "to move on to City College."}, {"start": 1178.179, "end": 1180.699, "text": "Apparently, there's an elevated threat level at Greendale."}, {"start": 1180.699, "end": 1183.819, "text": "Don't worry, I'll check it out, personally."}, {"start": 1183.819, "end": 1184.6589999999999, "text": "- Whatever."}, {"start": 1187.6589999999999, "end": 1190.579, "text": "I just had a dream that I was a regular president."}, {"start": 1194.5389999999998, "end": 1197.299, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1197.299, "end": 1200.379, "text": "(indistinct chatter)"}, {"start": 1204.219, "end": 1206.379, "text": "- Don't call me Kick Puncher."}, {"start": 1206.379, "end": 1207.219, "text": "Call me."}, {"start": 1211.27, "end": 1214.0300000000002, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1220.51, "end": 1221.35, "text": "- This was fun."}, {"start": 1223.23, "end": 1224.23, "text": "Maybe you can observe me having dinner"}, {"start": 1224.23, "end": 1225.87, "text": "next time you're in town."}, {"start": 1225.87, "end": 1227.67, "text": "Honk twice for yes, once for no."}, {"start": 1227.67, "end": 1230.43, "text": "(phone beeps)"}, {"start": 1230.43, "end": 1231.27, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1232.95, "end": 1234.0300000000002, "text": "Cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 1238.0300000000002, "end": 1240.79, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1241.27, "end": 1243.008, "text": "[BLANK_AUDIO]"}]}